{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-azizi-riviera","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"azizi-riviera-azizi-developments-mbr-city","about":"Azizi Riviera - a beautiful, large-scale project located in the heart of Meydan in MBR City. The complex combines comfortable apartments and commercial real estate. Designed with solar panels and vertical landscaping, this architectural masterpiece is the ultimate expression of luxury and comfort.For sale are studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms, equipped with modern appliances. All apartments have balconies. The apartments have breathtaking panoramic views of the Dubai skyline, crystal lagoon and greenery. Interiors are made to the highest standards.The complex has its own infrastructure, which includes landscaped gardens, a large swimming pool for adults and children, recreation areas with cabanas and sun loungers, barbecue area, yoga area, cinema hall, outdoor chess area, a special area for dogs and large car parking, there is also a gym, play areas for children with toys.Residents of the complex can enjoy walks along the boulevard in the style of the French Riviera, exclusive boutiques and retail outlets, restaurants and cafes, not far from the complex there is a movie theater, opera house, ice rink, giant aquarium and other interesting objects.In walking distance there is everything you need for an ideal lifestyle. In a few minutes drive there are schools, clinics, shopping centers.Real estate in the central districts of Dubai is especially in demand, which significantly increases the speed of payback.","price":950000,"title":"Azizi Riviera","bitrix":{"id":600,"pf_id":"are.3.9233","source":null,"project_id":"Meydan One","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azizi Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Meydan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/